{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/GoogleAI/status/2120187753329791341","id":"2120187753329791341","text":"Our strongest frontier model, Gemini 4 Carbon, is now available.\n\nBuilt for deeply complex, long-horizon workflows that push a frontier model’s intelligence, Carbon delivers frontier performance in agentic workflows across complex knowledge work, software engineering and web development, cybersecurity, and scientific reasoning.\n\nWhile Gemini 4 Argon remains the ideal model for the majority of software engineering and knowledge work, Carbon steps in for your hardest tasks that push a model to its limits — from complex, multi-step debugging to open-ended scientific research.\n\nAvailable starting today:\n— Consumers: use it in the @GeminiApp and AI Mode in Search for Google AI Ultra subscribers\n— Developers and Enterprises: build via the API in @GoogleAIStudio and @AndroidStudio, Google @Antigravity for Google AI Ultra subscribers, and Gemini for business\n— Scientists and Researchers: apply for a chance to get 6 months free via @Antigravity\n— Cybersecurity Defenders: apply to join the Fairwind Program for access to Carbon for cyber\n\nWatch how Carbon brings reasoning and coding together, turning avian research into an interactive 3D simulation of a songbird’s vocal organ that synthesizes the sounds of six bird species live.","raw_text":{"text":"Our strongest frontier model, Gemini 4 Carbon, is now available.\n\nBuilt for deeply complex, long-horizon workflows that push a frontier model’s intelligence, Carbon delivers frontier performance in agentic workflows across complex knowledge work, software engineering and web development, cybersecurity, and scientific reasoning.\n\nWhile Gemini 4 Argon remains the ideal model for the majority of software engineering and knowledge work, Carbon steps in for your hardest tasks that push a model to its limits — from complex, multi-step debugging to open-ended scientific research.\n\nAvailable starting today:\n— Consumers: use it in the @GeminiApp and AI Mode in Search for Google AI Ultra subscribers\n— Developers and Enterprises: build via the API in @GoogleAIStudio and @AndroidStudio, Google @Antigravity for Google AI Ultra subscribers, and Gemini for business\n— Scientists and Researchers: apply for a chance to get 6 months free via @Antigravity\n— Cybersecurity Defenders: apply to join the Fairwind Program for access to Carbon for cyber\n\nWatch how Carbon brings reasoning and coding together, turning avian research into an interactive 3D simulation of a songbird’s vocal organ that synthesizes the sounds of six bird species live.","display_text_range":[0,1237],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[276,299],"id":"2120186886690115585","display":"pic.x.com/KSNrOQ0VVj","original":"https://t.co/KSNrOQ0VVj","replacement":"https://x.com/GoogleAI/status/2120187753329791341/video/1"},{"type":"mention","indices":[634,644],"original":"GeminiApp","id":"1806359170830172162"},{"type":"mention","indices":[750,765],"original":"GoogleAIStudio","id":"1742923424056713217"},{"type":"mention","indices":[770,784],"original":"AndroidStudio","id":"1613102274"},{"type":"mention","indices":[793,805],"original":"Antigravity","id":"1965856473084473347"},{"type":"mention","indices":[937,949],"original":"Antigravity","id":"1965856473084473347"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"GoogleAI","url":"https://x.com/GoogleAI","id":"33838201","followers":2486882,"following":30,"likes":1409,"media_count":1432,"name":"Google AI","description":"Making AI helpful for everyone. Show thinking ↓","raw_description":{"text":"Making AI helpful for everyone. Show thinking ↓","facets":[]},"location":"Mountain View, CA","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/33838201/1779424677","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2057682346074058752/zTpu89C1_200x200.jpg","joined":"Tue Apr 21 06:59:33 +0000 2009","protected":false,"website":{"url":"https://ai.google","display_url":"ai.google"},"verific